\title{SummaryTables: Publication-Ready Summary Tables for jamovi}
\description{
A comprehensive module for creating publication-ready summary and regression tables in jamovi, powered by gtsummary. 'Summary Table' creates classic "Table 1" summaries, including group comparisons with automatic statistical testing, effect sizes, and p-value adjustments. 'Continuous Table' summarizes a single continuous variable across multiple categorical variables, including automatic statistical testing and p-value adjustments. 'Cross Table' summarizes the association between two categorical variables using cross-tabulations, including automatic statistical testing. 'Likert Table' summarizes Likert scale items. 'Survival Table' creates Kaplan-Meier survival tables showing survival probabilities and median survival times. 'Multivariable Regression' fits multivariable linear, logistic, or Cox regression models. 'Univariable Regression' runs separate univariable linear, logistic, or Cox regression models for each predictor. Features include direct export to Word (.docx), 16 languages, and pre-built formatting for major journals.
}
